The code is from the Pex_Projects\Examples of Pex_Projects\Examples\ArrayList\ArrayListContractTest.cs . This is an example code that uses ArrayList from the System.Collections namespace and runs some Pex contracts on it.
You can run this test in your setup using the Visual Studio Test Explorer or manually adding this code to your current unit test project.
